<title>LATVIA: Latvia Saules Bank gets Riga bourse membership.</title>
<headline>Latvia Saules Bank gets Riga bourse membership.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian commercial bank Saules Bank, one of the 10 largest banks in the country, said on Monday it has become a member of the Riga stock exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;This will allow the bank to carry out all operations with securities on the stock exchange list and provide all services to clients,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Saules becomes the 17th member of the stock market, which has been operating for more than a year.</p>
<p>The bourse quotes stocks as well as Latvian government Treasury bills. Leading shares are  Unibanka, the country's largest commercial bank, and  Riga Transport Fleet.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
